# Safety boundaries

Cursor must never create or modify:

- Live trading interfaces
- Broker APIs
- Auto order placement logic
- OMS or EMS systems
- Portfolio Risk Brain
- Real account configuration files
- API keys
- Tokens
- Secrets
- Production credentials

## Never commit

- .env files
- credentials.json
- secrets/ directories
- data_store real market data files
- Large licensed market data files

## Data handling policy

- Use environment variables for credentials only when an Issue allows it
- Keep licensed market data local and out of git history
- Prefer docs and contracts over ad hoc local data dumps
